《达拉崩吧》 — 16-bit Pixel RPG 复刻版 MV
========================================

Visual Direction & Pixel Sprite Synthesis
  320×180 indexed 144-colour framebuffer (×6 nearest-neighbour → 1920×1080 @ 24fps)
  All 8 character sprites & 32×32 RPG portraits (`src/sprites_data.js`) are pixelized and palette-quantized directly from this repository's official character sheets in `assets/ai-girls/` (`full-v9/`, `walk-v14/`, `lyric-action-v13/`, `dance-v11/`, `whale-pet-study/`).

